ower/articleshow/133112588.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-10T21:48:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133112856,imgsize-162326.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Caver spots moving grass, uncovers one of Victoria’s longest caves]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133113469.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2006-an-australian-caver-saw-grass-moving-when-there-was-no-wind-digging-beneath-it-revealed-elk-river-now-one-of-victorias-longest-caves/articleshow/133113469.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2006-an-australian-caver-saw-grass-moving-when-there-was-no-wind-digging-beneath-it-revealed-elk-river-now-one-of-victorias-longest-caves/articleshow/133113469.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-10T21:49:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133113700,imgsize-165244.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[7.4-magnitude Colombia earthquake: 22 killed, buildings collapse; USGS says casualties 'could top 1,000']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133108795.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A significant earthquake jolted western Colombia on Monday, resulting in injuries and extensive destruction. fourty seven fatalities have been confirmed while multiple buildings collapsed across the country. Air travel was halted at several airports in various cities. The quake's impact was felt as far as Bogota and neighboring nations, raising concerns about possible aftershocks. Colombian President Abelardo de la Espriella is actively overseeing emergency response and recovery efforts.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/earthquake-shakes-colombia-causes-injuries-and-significant-damage/articleshow/133108795.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/earthquake-shakes-colombia-causes-injuries-and-significant-damage/articleshow/133108795.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-10T18:49:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133114265,imgsize-164484.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[No Proof Of YouTube Split: Fans speculate about Dalton and Sako; arrest claims stay unverified]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133076840.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[YouTuber Dalton Ain't Worried recently posted a heartfelt video that has triggered speculation about a potential split with his wife Sako. Observers have pointed out the couple's scarce public appearances lately, fueling rumors of marital strife. Additionally, unverified reports of an arrest in West Virginia from February have emerged, though no verified details are available. Despite this, their joint videos continue to showcase a united front as a married couple.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/are-dalton-aint-worried-and-sako-breakup-youtubers-emotional-video-dv-claims-and-arrest-reports-raise-questions/articleshow/133076840.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/are-dalton-aint-worried-and-sako-breakup-youtubers-emotional-video-dv-claims-and-arrest-reports-raise-questions/articleshow/133076840.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-10T04:59:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/d